Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had were about to\Ncollapse Oh just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,cut through the wind and make A stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,don't let the darkness\Nwin, just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone,\Nwe'll go where we all want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I'm a lover, but I'm also a\Nfighter, man or woman, I like it rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoiron Knuckles!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to find a good punching bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're just the perfect size!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A smack to his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For the record, these webs\Naren't just here to block you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all so extremely flammable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be over before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you were some kind of\Nhero coming to Blackleg's rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're every bit as quick as he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, you'll make a fool\Nof yourself, just like he did!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, little flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to blow me the sea of flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know your wilt, so do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wither and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That demon child shouldn't\Nbe allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do this world a favor and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You little heathen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A burden to your crew mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You would think you're something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful people from all\Nover the world have their
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,eyes on you because you\Ncan read the bone glyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.78,0:04:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a tool to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as they can use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs a personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who Who needs legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a tramp like you in your place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,is just so satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look, you ran all over the place,\Nand now the entire hall is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Call your friend here,\Na skeleton with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll clean up your trash like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If he cares enough to bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,These are very foolish things\Nyou're saying, Black Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I suspect you'll be\Nregretting your actions shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd run if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I said get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to learn to punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like hitting people with my fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking about a life\Nor death struggle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a slap won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, okay, then how\Nabout using your palm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know palm strikes to focus on speed over
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength. Throw it quick\Nand pull it back quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin meet your new secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon claw fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Who invited you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So you buzz off. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who teaches her
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will not. I will\Nyou aren't even a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,though I'm a fishman karate\Nassistant instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Both of you, leave her\Nbe. Hey, I'm helping Robin's grappling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,techniques are all she needs I'm\Njust worried because we won't be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,able to protect her anymore after\Nshe leaves I'm telling you she's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,perfectly capable but our fishman karate\Ntechniques would pair so well with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,robin's fighting style not as well\Nas my techniques would if you ask
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,me she has her own way of fighting\Nyou have to respect that that's what
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying it's great for palm strikes\Nsure but it would be devastating
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,with the dragon claw fist or her\Npalm why don't you let robin speak
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,there's still something I want to hear\Nyou say robin tell me you want to live
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,help me robin help me please
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never thought about becoming\Nstronger for someone else's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,would you stop worrying I'll handle\Nthis why don't you stop worrying and let
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Me handle it all right. A palm strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,sounds perfect show
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,me okay you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,mind sharing your secret techniques\Nof course not why would I mind you're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,one of us we love
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you watch
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,like this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,when you're You're in a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use this palm strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Fishman Island secret arc.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me afloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you even aiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A pawn strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've put my pawns to\Ngood use again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Find your enemy's core, then strike it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the core and strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheap plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are people in\Nthis world who need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And rely on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd do anything for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even turn into a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand jacuzzi, love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Black Maria is going in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that tramp is begging for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs arms and legs, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I need my arms and legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about yours, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Black Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid skeleton in a stupid ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Lady Black Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Black Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My team!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm considerate of you all to line up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll make this much easier. Yo-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Rockdown's orchestra!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.22,0:12:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Park, for waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I'm a little tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you appreciate\Nmy situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a whole month's worth\Nof my food you're eating, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You better return the favor once\Nwe're done with this whole mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you have so much food\Nwith you in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the power of my swamp, Swamp\NFruit, I'm like a bottomless pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat, what happened\Nto the captain up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Eel guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please use your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm capable of doing it! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy needs me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle must be won!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means we're going back up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, how could you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Going back to that place is suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.34,0:14:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lose, then nowhere we'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just the capital, but\Nthe land of Guano itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm as frightened as anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And to do that, I need your aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My power only works one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do what you ask,\Nthere's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The years that you sacrificed\Nwill never return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind will remain the same, but\Nyour body will become that of an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After all you've been through, a\Nsacrifice like that is simply too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What I need right now is to\Nbecome a full-grown dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never do such an awful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my lord,\Nbut you must reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you, we can\Nfind another way. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, use your right, right jutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make me into an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grow up for my\Ncountry and for its future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must use your power on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The 5,400 troops of the Samurai Pirate\NAlliance made a raid on Onigashima,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,facing 30,000 Beast Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But that gap in numbers diminished\Nin time thanks to Otama's Kimidango
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,strategy and the valiant efforts of\NLuffy's allies all over the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, even the high-ranked\NTobiropo have been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, Onigashima continues\Nits trek to the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon its dark shadow will loom\Nover the unsuspecting flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you serve that wretched beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that Orochi has\Nno right to the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As ninja, our duty is to serve the\NShogun, not question his legitimacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You call Odoshield, Rex,\Nbut you serve a failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A mere ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You speak ill of war, Odin! There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You always let your emotions\Nget the better of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A true ninja very such weaknesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your mighty techniques will fit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It is those very emotions that drive\Nus that give us joy and purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Every moment we spent\Nwith Lord Odin was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We cried together We laughed\Ntogether, and when our lord died,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we died with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We are but ghosts now, bound by\Nthe thread of Lord Odin's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.10,0:17:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our duty is not some burden to bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It is our pride, emboldened by every\Nfeeling we shared with Lord Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream worth dying for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, the darkness of Orochi\Nand Kaido will come to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And tomorrow will bring\Na bright future to Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a new arrow will be poured\Nwith Lord Momonosuke Ashokan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How many stand-ins do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:17:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Precious few, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:17:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You've butchered them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a waste of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only a few left, but the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,question is whose lives do they contain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened it's like something just\Nstabbed me what the hell happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't tell me it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was having fun. For a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might cut your own captain\Nto shreds without realizing it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you know you can't win,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll enjoy watching you fall\Ndeeper and deeper into despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your vow to defeat me has\Nbeen rendered meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only strike me down by\Nkilling your beloved partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Master! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It tickles my imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking of all the uncertainty and\Nsuffering you're hiding behind that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.22,0:19:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Entertain me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You are sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The price of betrayal\Nis very steep indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even your new Straw Hat pals can\Nsave you from what you've got coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's execution time, and\Nyour rats are getting bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a friend alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Markham go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.44,0:20:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He reached his physical limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to do this on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, it just tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight both of them at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want us to find Zoro\NJudo so he can finish him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, boss head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it normally take this long to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.94,0:21:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it used with\Nsuch extensive injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper! Miyagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If the drug's not\Nworking, take Mummy Judo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we injected him,\Nso it should take effect soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, we have to find\Nsome way to stop those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, they're going to wipe\Nout everyone on the entire floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Roro, Noah, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave him some strange treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:21:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't allow him any time to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't turn your back on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.36,0:22:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Real cute, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.12,0:22:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you\Nbastards cut down anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimwitted Dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You kicked up so much\Ndust I can barely see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna lickety-stickety\Nyou, Vinsmoke Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had Merry Pudding\Nlike Mama planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be here right now\Nteaming up with a bunch of idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.92,0:23:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.60,0:23:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell, worthless jammer scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take this outside, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.24,0:23:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to avenge Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.98,0:23:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I found Dorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.14,0:23:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's butcher him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beast Pilate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.54,0:23:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro Juno fought for Wado, so\Nwe'll fight to protect him. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.62,0:24:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Those samurai are all wounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.58,0:24:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finish them off at\Nthe same time as Rhino!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better follow them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know what's\Ngoing to happen to Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.12,0:24:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, King Pluton!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.24,0:25:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really making me work\Ntoday, aren't you, Mosshead?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.42,0:25:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get out of our way, Blackleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.26,0:25:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.12,0:25:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pure your plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.30,0:25:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A dying thistle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.04,0:25:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a story about this long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.90,0:25:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of the Great Red Wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.94,0:25:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It dwelled a race of people\Nwho've been burst into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,King the wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.30,0:26:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.00,0:26:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.28,0:26:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The white deer pirates off the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.54,0:26:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.98,0:26:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.14,0:26:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm satisfied now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.24,0:26:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've hogged the spotlight for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.46,0:26:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for the\Nreal star to take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.38,0:27:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.78,0:27:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.18,0:27:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Diably!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.28,0:27:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.58,0:27:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.94,0:27:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.54,0:27:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, straw hands, where to show us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.28,0:27:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.64,0:27:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm worried about later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Curly Browns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.32,0:28:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens if\Nwe win this battle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.82,0:28:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cross the threshold\Ninto the final stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and get a glimpse of Luffy\Nbecoming King of the Pirates.
